    "axis": "relevance",
    "evidence": "The screen clearly advances the intent-integrity story: users alter a bounded synthetic agentic-checkout event, POST it to /compose, compare Legacy Rules with Intent Integrity on the same event, and receive a fused-risk decision with five evidence layers and human-readable reasons. Real 200 responses and zero browser failures support demo credibility. However, the visible experience does not establish a Mastercard-specific connection beyond generic payment cues such as amount, payees, and checkout; it shows no network, issuer/acquirer, authorization, fraud, identity, or Mastercard-value evidence.",
